# Local/ephemeral deployment records. `sepolia.json` is a real artifact and IS
# committed once a deploy has happened; `sepolia.example.json` documents the
# shape in the meantime. Anything else is a throwaway local chain.
packages/shared/src/deployments/*.json
!packages/shared/src/deployments/sepolia.json
!packages/shared/src/deployments/sepolia.example.json
